            <ArticleTitle>Should New Zealand continue signing up to the Pethidine Protocol?</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>U1875</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pethidine is no longer considered a first-line analgesic. The evidence for this view is critically presented. Clinicians around the World recommend its removal from health-systems or restriction of its use. New Zealand needs to follow these trends.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
